==Description==
The '''Premium Crate''' is a mid-tier crate of the game. This yields more sophisticated and aesthetically advanced skins than the [[Basic Crate]]. You are unable to get duplicates from this crate. Skins from this crate can appear in the daily shop.

Each skin that can be gotten from the '''Premium Crate''' has a rarity which affects how likely you are to unlock the skin and the price when it appears in the daily skin store. In the daily skin store, {{Color|Common}} skins cost {{Robux|85}}, {{Color|Uncommon}} skins cost {{Robux|105}}, {{Color|Rare}} skins cost {{Robux|120}} and {{Color|Legendary}} skins cost {{Robux|190}}.
==Appearance==
{{Tabber
|Current
|The '''Premium Crate''' is a blue, black and grey crate locked away with a lock that is opened with a blue key. It contains gold coins on the inside.
|Version 3
|Same as second version but with different textures.
|Version 2
|The crate had a sleek blue design, much thinner than the [[Basic Crate]] or [[Golden Crate]]. It had a dark blue keyhole and metal bands. It also had an insignia on top and front.
|Version 1
|The crate was a blue crate with an insignia on top of it.
}}

