==Trivia==
*The second design of the '''Premium Crate''' was only briefly used in [[Hardcore Testing BETA]].
*The current design of the '''Premium Crate''' could have been found in an old lobby prior to its release.
*Prior to 8th of May 2021, the first design of the '''Premium Crate''' could be seen with the description "''Yo momma!''" when you first opened the ''Crates'' section of your inventory, if you owned any [[crates]].
**This was used as a placeholder.
*During [[Hardcore Testing BETA]], all the skins that were in the [[Deluxe Crate]] when it was first added were available in the '''Premium Crate'''.
**In addition to those skins, the {{Color|Premium|Hazmat}} skin for the [[Accelerator]] and {{Color|Premium|Ninja}} skin for the [[Archer]] were available during [[Hardcore Testing BETA]]. 
***These skins were later removed in the [[Overhaul v1.0|Overhaul Update]].
*This crate contains the most skins in the game.
*This crate may be based on the [[w:c:r2da:Premium Skincrate|Premium Crate]] from ''R2DA''.

